Package: codeGrader
Type: Package
Title: Automated Execution Checks for Student R Homework
Version: 1.6.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Matthew C.", family = "Vanderbilt", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Quickly checks whether student homework submitted as R scripts (.R) or
    R Markdown files (.Rmd) runs without error. Each file runs in its own isolated R
    process with approved packages preloaded, risky calls neutralized, and data-import
    calls redirected to an instructor-chosen data file. Reports errors with their
    location and failing function (separating root errors from follow-on errors),
    audits package use against an approved list, checks that set.seed() precedes
    random-number code, flags hard-coded file paths, drafts feedback, and keeps
    cumulative CSV logs and a cohort Excel workbook with one worksheet per assignment.
URL: https://github.com/mcvanderbilt/code-library
BugReports: https://github.com/mcvanderbilt/code-library/issues
